          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "સોસાયટી — sosāyṭī — \"a housing society; a residential colony\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અમારી સોસાયટીમાં ચાળીસ ઘર છે. amārī sosāyṭīmā̃ cāḷīs ghar che. There are forty houses in our housing society."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "સોસાયટી (sosāyṭī) is borrowed from English society; in Gujarat a સોસાયટી is a planned group of houses with its own gate and committee."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
